  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "step-001",
      "title": "先为当前连接启用Sent消息断点 / Enable Sent messages for the current connection first",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-001.annotated.png",
      "rawImage": "step-001.png",
      "highlights": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "bounds": {
            "x": 2709.65625,
            "y": 625.921875,
            "width": 88.96875,
            "height": 44
          },
          "automationId": "capture.websocket.breakpoint.direction.sent"
        },
        {
          "label": "2",
          "bounds": {
            "x": 2864.0625,
            "y": 795.921875,
            "width": 275.9375,
            "height": 60
          },
          "automationId": "capture.websocket.breakpoint.enable"
        }
      ],
      "coordinateSpace": "image-pixels",
      "sourceViewport": {
        "width": 1600,
        "height": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-002",
      "title": "准备：先建立真实 WebSocket 并通过产品 UI 启用断点，再创建 HTTP Rule，避免 Upgrade 被该 Rule 挂起。 / Arrange: establish the real WebSocket first, enable its product breakpoint, then create the HTTP Rule.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-002.png",
      "rawImage": "step-002.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-003",
      "title": "断言sequence归属：后到且未挂起的入站历史帧必须排在出站pending帧之后。 / Assert sequence ownership: a later unpaused inbound frame stays after the pending outbound frame.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-003.png",
      "rawImage": "step-003.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-004",
      "title": "为独立消息队列改选Both / Select Both for the independent message queue",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-004.annotated.png",
      "rawImage": "step-004.png",
      "highlights": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "bounds": {
            "x": 2616,
            "y": 625.921875,
            "width": 89.65625,
            "height": 44
          },
          "automationId": "capture.websocket.breakpoint.direction.both"
        }
      ],
      "coordinateSpace": "image-pixels",
      "sourceViewport": {
        "width": 1600,
        "height": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-005",
      "title": "准备主场景：停用单向配置，再通过产品UI启用双向断点。 / Arrange the main scenario with both directions enabled.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-005.png",
      "rawImage": "step-005.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-006",
      "title": "响应与请求共用HTTP队列，Queued响应只读 / Responses share the HTTP queue and a Queued response is read-only",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-006.annotated.png",
      "rawImage": "step-006.png",
      "highlights": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "bounds": {
            "x": 522,
            "y": 248,
            "width": 1780,
            "height": 104
          },
          "automationId": "capture.request-row.ex-mvic53yi-7kcreh76"
        }
      ],
      "coordinateSpace": "image-pixels",
      "sourceViewport": {
        "width": 1600,
        "height": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-007",
      "title": "构造 pending：挂起一条 HTTP 请求，再按顺序制造当前连接的出站与入站帧断点。 / Arrange pending traffic: hold one HTTP request, then create ordered outbound/inbound pending frames.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-007.png",
      "rawImage": "step-007.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-008",
      "title": "断言筛选：方向控件同时筛选历史与pending行，但不改变逻辑队列位置。 / Assert filtering: direction controls filter history and pending rows without renumbering the queue.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-008.png",
      "rawImage": "step-008.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-009",
      "title": "断言当前连接只有一个可编辑队首，第二条为可选择但不可编辑的 queued 行。 / Assert the current connection exposes one editable head and one queued non-editor row.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-009.png",
      "rawImage": "step-009.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-010",
      "title": "断言列表完整性：同一pending帧不得与已捕获的历史行重复渲染。 / Assert list integrity: one pending frame must not duplicate its already-captured history row.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-010.png",
      "rawImage": "step-010.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-011",
      "title": "HTTP队首先保留自己的Text草稿 / Keep the HTTP head’s own Text draft",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-011.annotated.png",
      "rawImage": "step-011.png",
      "highlights": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "bounds": {
            "x": 2332,
            "y": 1401,
            "width": 840,
            "height": 188
          },
          "automationId": "breakpoints.body"
        }
      ],
      "coordinateSpace": "image-pixels",
      "sourceViewport": {
        "width": 1600,
        "height": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-012",
      "title": "断言草稿归属：HTTP与WebSocket队首在切换选择后分别保留自己的内存编辑。 / Assert draft ownership: HTTP and WebSocket heads retain separate in-memory edits across selection changes.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-012.png",
      "rawImage": "step-012.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-013",
      "title": "WebSocket队首使用独立草稿 / Keep a separate draft for the WebSocket head",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-013.annotated.png",
      "rawImage": "step-013.png",
      "highlights": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "bounds": {
            "x": 2368,
            "y": 1302.75,
            "width": 728,
            "height": 164
          },
          "automationId": "breakpoints.body"
        }
      ],
      "coordinateSpace": "image-pixels",
      "sourceViewport": {
        "width": 1600,
        "height": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-014",
      "title": "布局断言：Original容器按实际正文定高，不保留旧185px下限。 / Layout assertion: the Original container follows its body instead of the old 185px minimum.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-014.png",
      "rawImage": "step-014.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-015",
      "title": "只原样放行当前WebSocket队列 / Continue only the current WebSocket queue unchanged",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-015.annotated.png",
      "rawImage": "step-015.png",
      "highlights": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "bounds": {
            "x": 2894.84375,
            "y": 873,
            "width": 145.15625,
            "height": 42
          },
          "automationId": "breakpoints.continue-queue"
        }
      ],
      "coordinateSpace": "image-pixels",
      "sourceViewport": {
        "width": 1600,
        "height": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-016",
      "title": "操作：只继续 WebSocket 队列；HTTP 队列以及命令开始后产生的未来 echo 必须继续等待。 / Act: continue the WebSocket queue only; the HTTP queue and a future echo must remain pending.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-016.png",
      "rawImage": "step-016.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-017",
      "title": "最后单独原样放行HTTP队首 / Continue the HTTP head separately at the end",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-017.annotated.png",
      "rawImage": "step-017.png",
      "highlights": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "bounds": {
            "x": 2781.546875,
            "y": 1653,
            "width": 136.53125,
            "height": 60
          },
          "automationId": "breakpoints.continue-unmodified"
        }
      ],
      "coordinateSpace": "image-pixels",
      "sourceViewport": {
        "width": 1600,
        "height": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-018",
      "title": "请求放行后单独继续响应队首 / Continue the response head after the request is released",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-018.annotated.png",
      "rawImage": "step-018.png",
      "highlights": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "bounds": {
            "x": 2781.546875,
            "y": 1653,
            "width": 136.53125,
            "height": 60
          },
          "automationId": "breakpoints.continue-unmodified"
        }
      ],
      "coordinateSpace": "image-pixels",
      "sourceViewport": {
        "width": 1600,
        "height": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-019",
      "title": "操作与断言：释放未来 WebSocket 项，再单独释放 HTTP 队首，证明两个逻辑队列互不阻塞。 / Act and assert: release the future WebSocket item, then release HTTP through its own queue head.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-019.png",
      "rawImage": "step-019.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-020",
      "title": "只丢弃当前WebSocket队列 / Drop only the current WebSocket queue",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-020.annotated.png",
      "rawImage": "step-020.png",
      "highlights": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "bounds": {
            "x": 2918.84375,
            "y": 941,
            "width": 94.140625,
            "height": 42
          },
          "automationId": "breakpoints.drop-queue"
        }
      ],
      "coordinateSpace": "image-pixels",
      "sourceViewport": {
        "width": 1600,
        "height": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-021",
      "title": "两个队列都已处理，停用后新消息正常到达 / Both queues are resolved and new messages arrive after disabling",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-021.png",
      "rawImage": "step-021.png"
    }
